    "id": "IsStrictOrder",
    "package": "SetTheory",
    "kind": "def",
    "title": "严格偏序关系",
    "content": {
      "snl": "variable[native_default](__list__[native_default](Type.annotation[default](@$α$,Type.Sort(%u_1%)),Type.annotation[default](@$r$,Type.forall[arrow](@$a$,$α$@#0.0.0,Type.forall[arrow](@$a\\_1$@a_1,$α$@#0.0.0,Type.Sort[prop](%0%))))),structure[native_prop](IsStrictOrder($α$@#0.0.0,$r$@#0.1.0),__enum__[native_enumerate](member[native_colon](@$\\mathsf{toIrrefl}$@toIrrefl,Std.Irrefl($α$@#0.0.0,$r$@#0.1.0)),member[native_colon](@$\\mathsf{toIsTrans}$@toIsTrans,IsTrans($α$@#0.0.0,$r$@#0.1.0)))))",
      "markdown": "\n\nThis proposition-valued class asserts irreflexivity and transitivity of a relation. It is not a `PartialOrder α` structure; `partialOrderOfSO` constructs the corresponding non-strict order.\n"
